  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Enterprise Integrity Project (PEIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">anti-corruption project aimed at mitigating corruption risks in the public sector, and publicly owned enterprises in particular. The project will work with two key public corporations, to be selected in cooperation with the Government, in order to mitigate risks to public funding through mismanagement, fraud and corruption.  The project will also help create a baseline for future anti-corruption activities and test the project approach and methodology for scaling up potential.</narrative>
  </description>
